EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I just can't contain myself!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
This rain is making me happy,
so deal with it,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Youhou ! Ô joie céleste !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Cette pluie est aussi douce que ma
peau, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Loving the rain as much as I am?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Yeah, I can't blame you, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I hope it never ends, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Yağmuru benim kadar mı seviyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
